+var (
+	rsaCertificate       Certificate
+	rsa1024Certificate   Certificate
+	rsaChainCertificate  Certificate
+	ecdsaP256Certificate Certificate
+	ecdsaP384Certificate Certificate
+	ecdsaP521Certificate Certificate
+)
